RegimeDecisionLabel.description:
Prediction targets: not_eligible = reference selection is not separate-scale;
supported = eligible and separation-test p-value upper bound <= 0.05;
unsupported = eligible and lower bound > 0.05; unresolved = eligible and
lower <= 0.05 < upper. These are offline numerical rank bounds, not served
scores or confidence intervals. Unresolved is never a serving failure.

